":"danhee","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"몸을 한껏 움직인 후, 시원한 우유 한 잔은 어떤가.","texts":{"en":"How about a cold glass of milk after working up a sweat?","ja":"体を存分に動かした後の、冷たい牛乳一杯は格別だぞ","zh-Hans":"尽情活动身体之后，来一杯冰凉的牛奶如何。","zh-Hant":"在酣暢淋漓地活動完身體後，來一杯冰涼的牛奶如何？","th":"หลังจากออกกำลังกายเต็มที่แล้ว ดื่มนมเย็นๆ สักแก้วเป็นอย่างไรล่ะ","es":"Tras ejercitar el cuerpo a fondo, ¿qué tal si os tomáis un vaso de leche fresca?"},"author":"danhee"},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":33,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"StopBgm","line":35,"fields":{"FadeOutDuration":"1"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":37,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"healthy_blue_201.silence","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":38,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"healthy_blue_201.happy","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":38,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"healthy_blue_201","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"오... 그 흉부라면, 뭔가 설득력 있어.","texts":{"en":"Oh... Coming from someone with a chest like that, that's actually convincing.","ja":"おお…あの胸部が言うと、妙な説得力があるな","zh-Hans":"哦……顶着那样的胸部说这种话，还真有说服力。","zh-Hant":"喔……有那樣的胸部，講起話來還真有說服力。","th":"โอ้... ถ้าเป็นทรวงอกคู่นั้นละก็ ดูมีน้ำหนักน่าเชื่อถือขึ้นมาเลย","es":"Oh... Viniendo de un tórax como el suyo, resulta de lo más convincente."},"author":"healthy_blue_201"},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":40,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"healthy_red_301.love","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":41,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"healthy_red_301.happy","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":41,"inline":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"healthy_red_301","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"...얼마나 대단한 대흉근이 저 아래 숨어 있을까...","texts":{"en":"...I wonder how magnificent the pectorals hidden under there must be...","ja":"…あの下に、どれほど見事な大胸筋が隠されているのだろうか…","zh-Hans":"……那底下究竟藏着多么惊人的胸大肌啊……","zh-Hant":"……那件衣服底下，到底藏著多麼驚人的大胸肌啊……","th":"...กล้ามเนื้อหน้าอกซ่อนอยู่ใต้ความยิ่งใหญ่นั่นขนาดไหนกันนะ...","es":"...Me pregunto qué pecaminoso pectoral mayor se ocultará ahí debajo..."},"author":"healthy_red_301"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":43,"fields":{}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":44,"fields":{"ActorIds":"hinata"}},{"class":"CharacterDisappearToLeftCommand","line":45,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"danhee","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterAppearToRightCommand","line":46,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hinata.embarrassed","Wait":"false","Destination":"20","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":47,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.2"}},{"class":"PlayBgm","line":49,"fields":{"BgmPath":"bgm_story_039","FadeInDuration":"3","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"1"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":51,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hinata","Wait":"false","Power":"2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":52,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"hinata.chaos","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":53,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"hinata","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"싸, 싸우다 말고 무, 무슨 소리를 하는 거예요!!!","texts":{"en":"W-What are you even talking about in the middle of a fight!!!","ja":"た、戦いながら、なにを言っているんですか！！！","zh-Hans":"打、打着架呢，你、你们在胡说什么啊！！！","zh-Hant":"妳、妳們吵到一半，到、到底在說什麼啦！！！","th":"กำลัง... กำลังสู้กันอยู่แท้ๆ พูด... พูดเรื่องอะไรกันคะเนี่ย!!!","es":"¡¿P-Pero qué están diciendo en medio de una pelea?!"},"author":"hinata"},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":55,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"CharacterJumpCommand","line":57,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"healthy_blue_201","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":58,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"healthy_blue_201.angry","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":59,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"healthy_blue_201.default","Wait":"0","Lazy":"0","IsGenericPrefix":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":59,"inline":1,"fie